summary: Enable PT logging required for ptdump test
description: |
    Enable PT logging required for crash-ptdump-command test

    Hardware Dependencies:
    Intel CPU with Intel PT feature (Broadwell or later) i.e. CPUs has intel_pt flag
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
component:
  - crash-ptdump-command
test: make run
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - perf
duration: 10m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/config-ptdump
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/config-ptdump
